; medium: lines is sorted by (l_order, l_no); after an IDX filter the rows stay sorted, so the SORT is the identity (S9). The second SORT (DESC) is NOT the identity and must stay
LOAD   lo, lines.l_order
LOAD   ln, lines.l_no
LOAD   lq, lines.l_qty
LOAD   lp, lines.l_price
GT     m, lq, 10
IDX    i, m
GATHER a, lo, i
GATHER b, ln, i
GATHER c, lp, i
SORT   s, a ASC NF, b ASC NF
GATHER a1, a, s
GATHER b1, b, s
GATHER c1, c, s
SORT   t, a1 DESC NF
GATHER a2, a1, t
GATHER b2, b1, t
GATHER c2, c1, t
OUT    a2, b2, c2
